{"type":"message","id":"6f368301","parentId":"4c2b1b32","timestamp":"2026-06-01T17:32:38.883Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error. This could mean:\n1. The Worker is overloaded\n2. The Worker hit a resource limit\n3. There's an issue with the Workers platform itself\n\nThe 1101 error specifically is \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" in Cloudflare Workers. This is likely a transient issue with the platform. Let me try again with a simple ping.\n\nActually, this could be because the Worker is hitting CPU time limits or memory limits. The error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers specific error.\n\nLet me check the platform status by trying the root endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"e21720c660342dfe2278814e83c7817364fee91fe69c66fca576c82c6cace281"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7a4zdzy2jg40_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":7357,"output":180,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21219,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780335154364,"responseId":"066cf5332635da688fd11877adc00939"}}
